---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Voice — xAI — Rycode"
  description="Grok Voice: speech-to-speech, speech-to-text, text-to-speech."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">xAI · Grok lab</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">Voice</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">Spoken Grok surface: speech-to-speech, speech-to-text, and text-to-speech. Prices below prefer the live docs.x.ai models table (fetched 13 Sep 2026) over marketing shorthand.</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">API family (as published)</h2>
    <div class="ai-model-table-wrap">
      <table class="ai-model-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Mode</th>
            <th scope="col">Published id / notes</th>
            <th scope="col">Price (docs.x.ai, 13 Sep 2026)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Speech to Speech</td>
            <td>grok-voice-think-fast-2.0 — current STS on pricing</td>
            <td>$0.08/min audio + $0.004 text input</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Speech to Text</td>
            <td>REST / Streaming</td>
            <td>$0.10/hr REST, $0.20/hr Streaming</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Text to Speech</td>
            <td></td>
            <td>$15.00 / 1M characters</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>grok-voice-think-fast-1.0</td>
            <td>Marked Deprecated on the models Voice table</td>
            <td>Confirm live status on docs</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Reconcile against marketing</h2>
    <p>x.ai/api’s marketing table has also shown “starting at $0.05/min” for speech-to-speech. That is not the same row as docs.x.ai’s $0.08/min + $0.004 text input. Prefer the models/pricing table when the two disagree, and date the quote.</p>

    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/models">Models</a> (fetched 13 Sep 2026)</li>
      <li><a href="https://docs.x.ai/developers/pricing">Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://x.ai/api">x.ai/api</a> — marketing table, including the $0.05/min STS line</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
